  "updated_at": "2026-03-28",
  "bio": "Step into Noble Rose Tattoo, a Worthing-based inking haven where the time-honored traditions of tattoo artistry are revered and celebrated. Specializing in classic styles, our talented artists—@jshdavies, @rebeccaelisetattoo, and @morbidpen—weave their needles with the precision of old masters, bringing your visionary ink to life. Open Wednesday through Saturday, from 11 AM to 5 PM, and by appointment on Mondays and Tuesdays, Noble Rose Tattoo invites you to partake in a bespoke tattooing experience, merging timeless elegance with modern flair.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Worthing, England, United Kingdom\n\n•@jshdavies•\n•@morbidpen•\n•@rebeccaelisetattoo•\n————————————\nWeds - Sat • 11am-5pm \n*Mondays/Tuesdays Appointments Only*",
